  "name": "Example: Drawing Equal Vectors",
  "problem": "Consider a vector $\\textbf{a}$ and a point $O$ (shown below). Draw a vector that is equal to the vector $\\textbf{a}$ and has its tail at $O.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14196310/assets/571e2d2a8ffab997a13f99973a8605c5b9b410439239a3acef5a7fd1dac939ae.png)",
